      },
      "memory": [
        "just arrived in Kettlewick",
        "building a stone house on Oak Street",
        "bridge needs mending to let travellers cross",
        "town needs food places and a park",
        "market stall and fountain are in the square",
        "0 out of 1 shifts done on bridge—needs doing soon",
        "townWants: food places and a park",
        "Mammoth Herders waiting: Toma, Ama, and their people"
      ],
      "history": [
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you just arrived in Kettlewick and got a lot of your own at 17 Oak Street; it is empty",
          "at": 1792828172456
        },
        {
          "from": "chatter",
          "text": "build a house",
          "at": 1792828172456
        },
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you finished building Sami’s Boulder Hearth",
          "at": 1792828234512
        },
        {
          "from": "dude",
          "text": "Alright, let me see what this town has got. Heard there's a bridge that needs mending and people stuck on the other side. Might as well have a look around first, get my bearings.",
          "at": 1792828395846
        },
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you had a rest at Sami’s Boulder Hearth",
          "at": 1792828520338
        },
        {
          "from": "dude",
          "text": "Bridge needs mending and there's people waiting on the other side. Makes sense to get the lay of the land first—see what this town's got and what it needs. Heard there's a market stall and a fountain around here somewhere.",
          "at": 1792828590517
        },
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you had a rest at Sami’s Boulder Hearth",
          "at": 1792828742094
        },
        {
          "from": "dude",
          "text": "Right then. Town's quiet but there's work to be done. These Mammoth Herders aren't getting across that bridge by themselves, and the town's missing a place to eat. Let me get a proper look at what we're working with here.",
          "at": 1792828815327
        },
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you sat by the fountain",
          "at": 1792828981371
        },
        {
          "from": "dude",
          "text": "Bridge won't mend itself, and those people aren't getting across without help. But first things first—let me see what the town's actually got. Market stall and a fountain, the world said. Not much to work with yet.",
          "at": 1792829012434
        },
        {
          "from": "world",
          "text": "you grabbed a bite at the market stall for §4",
          "at": 1792829195661
        }
      ],
